        <main class="main">
            <header class="top"><div><h1>QATAR NATIONAL DIGITAL HEALTH MISSION (QNDHM)</h1><p>Healthcare Facilities Status, Integration and Action Dashboard &bull; Illustration Purpose Only</p></div><select id="period"><option>Current Quarter</option><option>Last Quarter</option><option>Year to Date</option></select></header><div class="page">
        <div class="hero"><div><h2>Qatar Healthcare Facility Universe</h2><div>Track the complete journey from Sandbox registration through Development, UAT, Security, Pre-Production and Live operation.</div></div><div class="hero-right"><b>1,425 Facilities</b><small>User-provided planning baseline</small></div></div>
        <div class="grid universe"><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('type','')"><span>Total Qatar Facilities</span><b>1,425</b><small>100% planning universe</small></div><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('type','Hospital')"><span>Hospitals</span><b>25</b><small>1.8% of total</small></div><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('type','Clinic / Polyclinic')"><span>Clinics & Polyclinics</span><b>400</b><small>28.1% of total</small></div><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('type','Pharmacy')"><span>Pharmacies</span><b>1,000</b><small>70.2% of total</small></div></div>

        <div class="section-title"><div><h3>Facility Onboarding Status</h3><small>380 facilities are registered in Sandbox. Child stages reconcile exactly to the registered total.</small></div><span class="pill blue">Logically reconciled counts</span></div>
        @* <div class="grid statusgrid"><div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('registered','All Registered')"><span>Registered in Sandbox</span><b>380</b><small>26.7% of Qatar facility universe</small></div><div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','In Development')"><span>In Development</span><b>45</b><small>Active API and workflow development</small></div><div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Sandbox Development Complete')"><span>Sandbox Development Complete</span><b>50</b><small>Sandbox scope completed</small></div><div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','UAT')"><span>In UAT</span><b>20</b><small>User acceptance testing</small></div><div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Security')"><span>In Security</span><b>10</b><small>Security assessment in progress</small></div><div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Pre-Production')"><span>Pre-Production</span><b>8</b><small>Ready for production preparation</small></div><div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Live / Integrated')"><span>Live / Integrated</span><b>30</b><small>20 last quarter + 10 this quarter</small></div><div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Not Started')"><span>Not Started</span><b>217</b><small>Registered but delivery not initiated</small></div>
</div> *@
        
            <div class="grid statusgrid">
                <div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('registered','All Registered')"><span>Registered in Sandbox</span><b>380</b><small>26.7% of Qatar facility universe</small><div class="mini-progress"><i style="width:26.7%"></i></div></div>
                <div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','In Development')"><span>In Development</span><b>45</b><small>Active API & workflow development</small><div class="mini-progress"><i style="width:11.8%"></i></div></div>
                <div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Sandbox Development Complete')"><span>Sandbox Development Complete</span><b>50</b><small>Sandbox scope completed</small><div class="mini-progress"><i style="width:13.2%"></i></div></div>
                <div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','UAT')"><span>In UAT</span><b>20</b><small>User acceptance testing</small><div class="mini-progress"><i style="width:5.3%"></i></div></div>
                <div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Security')"><span>In Security</span><b>10</b><small>Security assessment in progress</small><div class="mini-progress"><i style="width:2.6%"></i></div></div>
                <div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Pre-Production')"><span>Pre-Production</span><b>8</b><small>Ready for production preparation</small><div class="mini-progress"><i style="width:2.1%"></i></div></div>
                <div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Live / Integrated')"><span>Live / Integrated</span><b>30</b><small>20 last quarter + 10 this quarter</small><div class="mini-progress"><i style="width:7.9%"></i></div></div>
                <div class="card statuscard click" onclick="filterBy('stage','Not Started')"><span>Not Started</span><b>217</b><small>Registered but delivery not initiated</small><div class="mini-progress"><i style="width:57.1%"></i></div></div>
            </div>

        <div class="grid two">
            @* <section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Quarterly Integration Performance</h3><small>20 last quarter and 10 this quarter. Planned 18, 8 Pre-Production and 10 Security.</small></div></div><div class="body grid quarters"><div class="qcard" onclick="filterBy('quarter','Last Quarter')"><span>Integrated Last Quarter</span><b>20</b><small>Q2 2026</small></div><div class="qcard" onclick="filterBy('quarter','This Quarter')"><span>Integrated This Quarter</span><b>10</b><small>Q3 2026 to date</small></div><div class="qcard" onclick="filterBy('quarter','Planned This Quarter')"><span>Planned This Quarter</span><b>18</b><small>8 Pre-Prod + 10 Security</small></div></div></section> *@
                <section class="panel">
                    <div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Integration performance</h3><small>Quarterly live and planned movement</small></div></div>
                    <div class="body metric-list">
                        <div class="metric" onclick="filterBy('quarter','Last Quarter')"><div class="metric-line"><span>Integrated last quarter</span><b>20</b></div><small>Q2 2026</small></div>
                        <div class="metric" onclick="filterBy('quarter','This Quarter')"><div class="metric-line"><span>Integrated this quarter</span><b>10</b></div><small>Q3 2026 to date</small></div>
                        <div class="metric" onclick="filterBy('quarter','Planned This Quarter')"><div class="metric-line"><span>Planned this quarter</span><b>18</b></div><small>8 Pre-Production + 10 Security</small></div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            <section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Registered Facility Technology Landscape</h3><small>Technology breakup reconciles to all 380 Sandbox-registered facilities.</small></div></div><div class="body grid techgrid"><div class="card techcard click" onclick="filterBy('tech','HMIS')"><span>HMIS</span><b>210</b> <small>Hospital / clinic information systems</small> </div><div class="card techcard click" onclick="filterBy('tech','LMIS')"><span>LMIS</span><b>45</b> <small>Laboratory management systems</small> </div><div class="card techcard click" onclick="filterBy('tech','Pharmacy Platform')"><span>Pharmacy Platform</span><b>100</b> <small>Retail and ePrescription systems</small> </div><div class="card techcard click" onclick="filterBy('tech','HealthTech')"><span>HealthTech</span><b>25</b> <small>Digital health apps and platforms</small> </div></div></section></div>

        <div class="section-title"><div><h3>Support Ticket Monitoring</h3><small>Facility-linked ticket load and current ticket status.</small></div></div><div class="grid ticketgrid"><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('ticket','Raising Tickets')"><span>Facilities Raising Tickets</span><b>83</b><small>Distinct facilities</small></div><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('ticket','Open')"><span>Open Tickets</span><b>126</b><small class="pill red">Needs action</small></div><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('ticket','In Progress')"><span>In Progress</span><b>74</b><small class="pill blue">Assigned</small></div><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('ticket','Awaiting Facility')"><span>Awaiting Facility</span><b>29</b><small class="pill amber">Follow-up</small></div><div class="card click" onclick="filterBy('ticket','Resolved')"><span>Resolved This Month</span><b>112</b><small class="pill green">Completed</small></div></div>
        <div class="grid two" style="margin-top:14px"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Cycle-Time Dashboard</h3><small>Calculated only for the 30 live facilities as Live Date minus First Ticket Creation Date.</small></div></div><div class="body grid cyclegrid"><div class="card cycle-card click" onclick="filterBy('cycle','0–60 days')"><span>0–60 Days</span><b>12</b><small class="pill green">Fast</small></div><div class="card cycle-card click" onclick="filterBy('cycle','60–90 days')"><span>60–90 Days</span><b>9</b><small class="pill blue">Within target</small></div><div class="card cycle-card click" onclick="filterBy('cycle','90–150 days')"><span>90–150 Days</span><b>6</b><small class="pill amber">Watch</small></div><div class="card cycle-card click" onclick="filterBy('cycle','Over 150 days')"><span>Over 150 Days</span><b>3</b><small class="pill red">Escalate</small></div></div></section>
        @* <section class="panel actions"><div class="panel-head"><h3>Facility Action Plan</h3><p>Priorities requiring delivery attention</p><span class="pill red">7 items</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Move 8 Pre-Production facilities to Live</span><span class="pill red">Immediate</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Close security assessment for 10 facilities</span><span class="pill red">Immediate</span></div><div class="row"><span>Complete UAT for 20 facilities</span><span class="pill amber">This week</span></div><div class="row"><span>Move 50 Sandbox-complete facilities into UAT</span><span class="pill amber">This month</span></div><div class="row"><span>Accelerate development for 45 facilities</span><span class="pill amber">This month</span></div><div class="row"><span>Launch delivery planning for 217 Not Started facilities</span><span class="pill blue">Plan</span></div><div class="row"><span>Escalate 3 live facilities with cycle time above 150 days</span><span class="pill red">Escalate</span></div>
</section> *@
                <section class="panel actions">
                    <div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Action queue</h3><small>Priorities requiring delivery attention</small></div><span class="pill red">5 items</span></div>
                    <div class="action-list">
                        <div class="action"><i class="dot"></i><strong>Move 8 Pre-Production facilities to Live</strong><span class="pill red">Immediate</span></div>
                        <div class="action"><i class="dot"></i><strong>Close security assessment for 10 facilities</strong><span class="pill red">Immediate</span></div>
                        @* <div class="action"><i class="dot"></i><strong>Complete UAT for 20 facilities</strong><span class="pill amber">This week</span></div> *@
                        <div class="action"><i class="dot"></i><strong>Move 50 Sandbox-complete facilities into UAT</strong><span class="pill amber">This month</span></div>
                        @* <div class="action"><i class="dot"></i><strong>Accelerate development for 45 facilities</strong><span class="pill amber">This month</span></div> *@
                        <div class="action"><i class="dot"></i><strong>Plan delivery for 217 Not Started facilities</strong><span class="pill blue">Plan</span></div>
                        <div class="action" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);"><i class="dot"></i><strong>Escalate 3 live facilities above 150 days</strong><span class="pill red">Escalate</span></div>
                    </div>
                </section>
</div>
        <section class="panel list-panel" id="listPanel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3 id="listTitle">All Facility Records</h3><small id="listSub">Click a Facility ID for detailed information.</small></div><button onclick="resetFilters()">Reset List</button></div><div class="filters"><input id="search" placeholder="Search facility, ID, integrator, HMIS or SPOC" oninput="renderRows()"><select id="typeFilter" onchange="renderRows()"><option value="">All Facility Types</option><option>Hospital</option><option>Clinic / Polyclinic</option><option>Pharmacy</option></select><select id="statusFilter" onchange="renderRows()"><option value="">All Onboarding Stages</option><option>In Development</option><option>Sandbox Development Complete</option><option>UAT</option><option>Security</option><option>Pre-Production</option><option>Live / Integrated</option><option>Not Started</option></select><select id="techFilter" onchange="renderRows()"><option value="">All Technology Types</option><option>HMIS</option><option>LMIS</option><option>Pharmacy Platform</option><option>HealthTech</option></select><select id="ticketFilter" onchange="renderRows()"><option value="">All Ticket Statuses</option><option>Open</option><option>In Progress</option><option>Awaiting Facility</option><option>Resolved</option></select><button class="primary" onclick="exportCSV()">Export CSV</button></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Facility ID</th><th>Facility</th><th>Type</th><th>Integrator / Product</th><th>Technology</th><th>Current Stage</th><th>Development</th><th>UAT</th><th>Security</th><th>Pre-Production</th><th>Ticket Status</th><th>First Ticket</th><th>Live Date</th><th>Cycle Time</th><th>Last API Hit</th><th>Last Interaction</th><th>SPOC</th><th>Next Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="rows"></tbody></table></div><div id="empty" class="empty">No facility matches the selected filter.</div></section>@* <div class="footnote">Facility-universe counts of 25 hospitals, 400 clinics/polyclinics and 1,000 pharmacies were provided by the user. The 380 Sandbox registrations reconcile as 45 In Development + 50 Sandbox Development Complete + 20 UAT + 10 Security + 8 Pre-Production + 30 Live + 217 Not Started = 380. Technology also reconciles as 210 HMIS + 45 LMIS + 100 Pharmacy Platforms + 25 HealthTech = 380. Total Live reconciles as 20 last quarter + 10 this quarter = 30. Planned current-quarter go-lives reconcile as 8 Pre-Production + 10 Security = 18. Cycle-time buckets apply only to the 30 live facilities and total 30.</div> *@
    </div>
</main>
</div>
<div class="drawer-bg" id="drawerBg" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeDrawer()"><div class="drawer"><div class="drawer-head"><div><h2 id="dTitle"></h2><p id="dSub"></p></div><button class="close" onclick="closeDrawer()">×</button></div><div class="grid details" id="detailGrid"></div><section class="panel" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="panel-head"><h3>Facility Journey Timeline</h3></div><div class="body timeline" id="timeline"></div></section><section class="panel" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="panel-head"><h3>Recommended Next Actions</h3></div><div class="body" id="recommend"></div></section></div></div>
<script src="~/js/maindashboard.js"></script>
